WEBVTT

46:00.492 --> 46:02.286
(REPEATS DOTHRAKI WORD)

46:02.411 --> 46:04.079
Yes, Khaleesi.

46:05.914 --> 46:08.083
Oh, what are you doing?

46:08.208 --> 46:10.711
When was last time you bleed, Khaleesi?

46:13.213 --> 46:15.174
You change, Khaleesi.

46:16.592 --> 46:18.969
It's a blessing from the Great Stallion

46:24.391 --> 46:28.395
JORAH: For a man on horseback,
the curved blade is a good thing,

46:28.520 --> 46:30.230
easier to handle.
